# Apixaban + 10 H2O Born-Oppenheimer molecular dynamics
# Starting geometry: Apixaban + 10 H2O initial cluster
# Total atoms: 89
# Target test trajectory: 0.5 ps (1000 steps x 0.5 fs)

! MD r2SCAN-3c TightSCF

%pal
  nprocs 4
end

%maxcore 1500

%md
  Timestep 0.5_fs
  Initvel 298.15_K
  Thermostat NHC 298.15_K Timecon 20.0_fs
  Dump Position Stride 10 Filename "Apixaban_10H2O_MD.xyz"
  Run 1000
end

* xyzfile 0 1 Apixaban_Explicit10H2O_repositioned_initial.xyz
*
